  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘은 흡열 반응 실험입니다! 삼각 플라스크랑<br>나무판이랑 물 살짝 넣고, 실험 시작하면<br>나중에는 나무판이랑 플라스크랑 살얼음으로 얼어서 붙는 그 실험입니다! 이게 생각보다 잘됩니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3e13af13c6088d1037d87ce70be90a9cf918cea4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3e13af13c6088d1037d87ce70be90a9cf918cea4\" data-origin-width=\"493\" data-origin-height=\"415\"><div class=\"figcaption\">비상교육 교과서</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">센서로 실험하면 아래와 같습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be9f76be6a736ace4d68dafb8db645d72a64497c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be9f76be6a736ace4d68dafb8db645d72a64497c\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1475\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1ad8713b7cca2476192f25af629f2d7290bcf5c2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1ad8713b7cca2476192f25af629f2d7290bcf5c2\" data-origin-width=\"1021\" data-origin-height=\"1475\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f23b3cbdd6a116711c520ff051a24473fafd100c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f23b3cbdd6a116711c520ff051a24473fafd100c\" data-origin-width=\"1027\" data-origin-height=\"1465\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">다만, 물과 암모니아 가스가 형성되는데<br>냄새가 정말 지독합니다ㅎㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ<br>학생들이랑 실험할 때는 조심해서 하시길!!<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그\" data-og-description=\"영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다\" data-og-host=\"m.blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bZdgvE/dJMb9eTOoYI/Vkk5thk6vD6CSdMXvKF4I0/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bZdgvE/dJMb9eTOoYI/Vkk5thk6vD6CSdMXvKF4I0/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그</p><p class=\"og-desc\">영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다</p><p class=\"og-host\">m.blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
